                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "390a919e-fefb-3ee6-9352-cef4f18c8381",
                        "entry_id": "bb4187af-fc60-3158-b7bd-275cdb1057b8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Construction or maintenance of railroad tracks"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8104e414-26bd-4aa4-bfda-eb5263de627d",
                                "sense_id": "390a919e-fefb-3ee6-9352-cef4f18c8381",
                                "text": "The train is going to be delayed by ten minutes due to trackwork."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "926308a3-4231-4f7e-835b-6e822c0b2631",
                                "sense_id": "390a919e-fefb-3ee6-9352-cef4f18c8381",
                                "text": "A small number of weekday and weekend possessions will also be required on June 20-21, September 5-6, and between December 19-March 2021, but will coincide with when there will already be a limited (or no) service into London King's Cross in conjunction with the extensive trackwork taking place at the terminus."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "027afc5e-e7a3-3bf7-9585-bf5540be6d4a",
                        "entry_id": "bb4187af-fc60-3158-b7bd-275cdb1057b8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The tracks and associated equipment of a railway line."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "05221294-0a08-4fd5-bdcf-1a68610f54a0",
                                "sense_id": "027afc5e-e7a3-3bf7-9585-bf5540be6d4a",
                                "text": "The advantages of this policy were twofold - the operation of m.u. trains only, with their lighter axle load, would allow the trackwork and underbridges to be simpler and lighter in construction; and speeds up to 150 m.p.h. could more easily be achieved than with conventional locomotive-hauled trains."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0da537a9-0a75-4dd2-a760-473672658c7e",
                                "sense_id": "027afc5e-e7a3-3bf7-9585-bf5540be6d4a",
                                "text": "At present the principal exercise in resignalling and new trackwork involves the Pickering area."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f62ac157-069e-3af0-a941-f841dc102092",
                        "entry_id": "bb4187af-fc60-3158-b7bd-275cdb1057b8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Practice in racing around a track"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1b3463fe-ad9c-425b-940f-7cf3680da332",
                                "sense_id": "f62ac157-069e-3af0-a941-f841dc102092",
                                "text": "McDonald described Weekend Hussler's trackwork this preparation as \"frightening\"."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
